      "Turn-flow example: 1. **Ronda/Rondine**: After each 3-card deal, players with pairs announce 'ronda', with trips 'rondine'. After those 3 played, highest scores (K=4/12, Q=3/9, J=2/6, 2-A=1/3). 2. **Capture**: Play a card. Match = capture matched + ascending sequence (A above K). No match = card stays. 3. **Porrazo**: Previous play captured nothing; you play matching card = porrazo (bonus). Next player can counter porrazo with 3rd matching; 4th = san benito (instant win). 4. **Limpia**: Capture all table cards; score by last card rank. 5. **Cards in place**: A/2/3/4 played without capture so table count = card value; score that many. 6. **Tendido**: Dealer deals 4 face-up once; score A-4 in place, pairs/trips/fours.",
